    dct:type "resolution-route/mixed" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.79"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "Many observed molecular structures and energy models exist, enabling tests in selected domains. Coverage and reliable global-minimum identification are insufficient for the broad statement about complicated molecules generally." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: For preregistered classes of large molecules and glasses, compare experimentally observed structures with independently calculated global minimum-energy structures and characterized metastable basins. A predominance of demonstrably metastable observed states supports the restricted claim." ;
